# Bellbook's spec artifacts are byte-exact canonical forms: their SHA-256
# and JCS bytes are part of the contract, so they must be identical on every
# platform. Pin LF so a Windows checkout does not rewrite them with CRLF
# (which changed the frozen-artifact hashes and broke CI). Source files are
# LF too, for the same determinism.
*.json text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
